### Voxmetriks — smoke API (backend en :8000)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/../health

### Stats summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/summary

### Top tracks
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/top-tracks?limit=5

### Me Porto Bonito — audio source (YouTube)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tracks/57111/audio-source

### Me Porto Bonito — cover (iTunes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tracks/57111/cover
